# The city goal Hyde St at 50 on the squeezed city's top block of Hyde (Hyde below it to the bay is a removed
# block): from Lombard, pushing across the flat stretch by the crooked block, then letting the hill run: 50 km/h
# (13.9 m/s) near the foot of the block; a few km/h later the speed wobbles start and throw the skater.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 teleport -287.5 668 29.6 351
cmd 3 set skater.vel.x -0.78
cmd 3 set skater.vel.y 4.94
hold up 30..700
run 1400
expect event goalComplete{id=hyde50,name=Hyde St at 50} within 1148..1152
expect event bail{reason=speed wobbles} within 1326..1330
